        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. Upon request of the teacher, the Board shall provide direct deposit of each of the teacher's paychecks, including supplemental paychecks, to the financial institution of the teacher's choice. This provision shall be subject to mutually agreed upon regulations relating to direct deposit.",
