        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. The Board shall issue paychecks to teachers employed for the summer on the 8th and 22nd of each month. The first check shall be issued on July 8 of each year. If a scheduled payday is not a regular duty day, paychecks shall be issued on the last duty day prior to the scheduled payday. Final payments of salaries for the normal six-week summer program will be made by August 8. Insofar as possible, equal payments will be made on July 8, July 22, and by August 8.",
            "block_bbox": [
                77,
