        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6. Insofar as possible and feasible supplements shall be distributed in equal monthly payments with the last paycheck the employee receives each month. Payments for known recipients of athletic supplements, and Band Directors, for which activity begins prior to September 1, shall be made in the September 22 paycheck. All other known supplement receivers shall receive payment beginning with the October 22 paycheck.",
            "block_bbox": [
