            "block_content": "c. Half-time teaching shall be combined for salary credit, i.e., two (2) one-half (½) years or two (2) half-time years equals one (1) year of experience. One-half (½) year of teaching shall be defined as at least fifty (50) but less than ninety-nine (99) days, fifty (50) of which must be continuous, in any",
